[[0,1213715,0,72,1,71,"2016-08-05T15:43:36","Kookus","",[],"","Happy Birthday, Curiosity! Four years on Mars!","https://youtu.be/E6t1kxX-EpI","science"],[1,5996284,0,13,0,13,"2016-08-05T15:44:19","Kookus","",[],"<p>And remember, she's programmed to <a href=\"https://youtu.be/uxVVgBAosqg?t=1m7s\">sing happy birthday</a> to herself every year. </p>"],[2,5996743,5996284,4,0,4,"2016-08-05T16:40:55","FeelinFroggy","",[],"<p>That's neat, I never knew this. Thanks for sharing!</p>"],[2,5997013,5996284,4,0,4,"2016-08-05T17:11:17","AmaleksHairyAss","",[],"<p>cool!</p>"],[1,5996728,0,12,0,12,"2016-08-05T16:39:15","Lemongarb","",[],"<p>Don't forget that Opportunity is still going after 12 years even though it was only designed to last 90 days.</p>"],[2,5997053,5996728,6,0,6,"2016-08-05T17:16:51","AmaleksHairyAss","[e]",[],"<p>They <em>really</em> know how to build a robot. But sometimes I pretend aliens are secretly performing repairs up there.</p>"],[1,5996760,0,2,0,2,"2016-08-05T16:42:54","Lopsid","",[],"<p>I wonder if the rover will be reprogrammed to crawl like a bug once the aluminum wheels are completely destroyed.</p>"],[1,5997079,0,5,0,5,"2016-08-05T17:20:06","AmaleksHairyAss","",[],"<p>I can't think about the Mars rovers without remembering the XKCD about Spirit and getting depressed.</p>"],[2,6001416,5997079,2,0,2,"2016-08-06T02:29:19","PraiseIPU","",[],"<p>happy version <a href=\"http://imgs.xkcd.com/blag/spirit_rewrite_unknown_author.png\">http://imgs.xkcd.com/blag/spirit_rewrite_unknown_author.png</a></p>"],[1,5997287,0,2,0,2,"2016-08-05T17:42:48","kryptoniankoffee","",[],"<p>That's only a little over two Martian years.</p>"],[2,6000546,5997287,1,0,1,"2016-08-06T00:17:56","im_the_dude_man","",[],"<p>Yeah, I was gonna ask if it was in earth or mars years.</p>"],[1,5997666,0,2,1,1,"2016-08-05T18:22:34","1Sorry_SOB","",[],"<p>White people FTW!</p>"],[1,5997715,0,3,1,2,"2016-08-05T18:29:06","Clovereea","",[],"<p>Good. Happy Birthday </p>"],[1,5997788,0,2,0,2,"2016-08-05T18:36:36","rhabarba","",[],"<p>Come back soon, we miss you!</p>"],[1,5998024,0,3,0,3,"2016-08-05T18:59:53","transplo","",[],"<p>The next mars rover should get a live stream camera!﻿</p>"],[2,6002325,5998024,1,0,1,"2016-08-06T05:33:58","Karbuster","",[],"<p>I don't really consider 14 minutes of delay to be live...plus that kind of data trader would be incredibly expensive but for NASA and the robot</p>"],[3,6011517,6002325,1,0,1,"2016-08-07T13:40:10","transplo","",[],"<p>You're right, I didn't consider there's a 14 minute delay...</p>"],[1,5998268,0,0,4,-4,"2016-08-05T19:28:00","heroinwinsagain","[e]",[],"<p>They never sent a rover to mars. Stop being a bunch of kindergardeners. Watch the press conference. Watch the 1 test they did with the landing system that Snowden is at. </p>\n<p>Adam Stelzner when asked some pretty basic questions about the landing, keeps on referring to &quot;people in the crowd&quot; that are not there to answer some basic fundamental questions about the mission. </p>\n<p>The rover was to last 90 days, its been 4 years. </p>\n<p>&quot;This movie cost you less then seven bucks per american citizen and look at the excitement that we have brought and the inspiration&quot;\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=18m53s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=18m53s</a></p>\n<p>Stop &quot;believing&quot; this bullshit because other people do. And dont use the excuse that these are really smart people. They're really good liars. and we want to trust and believe people because, we would understand if they couldnt make these missions. </p>\n<p>Clips from the bullshit conference</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=28m29s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=28m29s</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=29m46s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=29m46s</a></p>\n<p>Bullshit Answers / Non Answers</p>\n<p>How was the landing? Calls out to someone who isnt at the press conference probably doesnt exist.\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=35m12s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=35m12s</a></p>\n<p>Boing boing .net question what was the file type image compression.\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=37m31s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=37m31s</a></p>\n<p>Coordinates for the landing, they dont know where it landed.\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=41m55s\">https://youtu.be/FVzfDZlEwaU?t=41m55s</a></p>\n<p>Rover Test landing bullshit with a glimps of edward snowden at 55 second mark of video\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KLx4St7y1_0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KLx4St7y1_0</a></p>\n<p>Dont kid yourself these are hi paid fucking liars.</p>"],[2,6000559,5998268,1,0,1,"2016-08-06T00:19:53","im_the_dude_man","",[],"<p>*Kindergarteners.</p>"],[2,6001435,5998268,2,0,2,"2016-08-06T02:33:30","PraiseIPU","",[],"<p>why lie? </p>"],[1,5998315,0,0,3,-3,"2016-08-05T19:34:11","heroinwinsagain","",[],"<p>ISS Green Screen</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AkkLO4oEQS4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AkkLO4oEQS4</a></p>"],[2,5998477,5998315,1,0,1,"2016-08-05T19:51:06","Kookus","",[],"<p>You can literally look up in the night sky and see the ISS, you rtard. What the hell do you think that is up there? They put all that together just to further the hoax? And they bounce HAM signals off of it to talk to random idiots, too? </p>"],[1,5998655,0,0,4,-4,"2016-08-05T20:11:33","heroinwinsagain","",[],"<p>The highly diluted gas in this layer can reach 2,500 °C (4,530 °F) during the day.</p>\n<p>So what metals or plastics are NASA using to go through this? It doesnt exist. To this day there is no material that can widthstand that temperature alone moreover at the supposed speeds they say they are traveling through it.</p>"],[2,6001125,5998655,3,0,3,"2016-08-06T01:41:33","tame","",[],"<p>&quot;highly diluted&quot; = basically a vacuum. It doesn't transfer heat to solid objects faster than they lose heat as black body radiation.</p>"]]
